+// Turns are for heroic's Nightmare portals in a 10-player raid. On normal the Dream clouds hurt nobody and their
+// Emerald Vigor stacks are the healing engine: with turns the dojo 10-normal raid at item level 264 peaked at 8-10
+// stacks instead of 18-38, needed 352 s instead of 249 s and lost her at 96% to the adds. 25-player was never tested
+// (one dreamer of five or six would starve her) and keeps 0021's behaviour.
